flowchart TD
  V["Vector: n numbers<br/>a point or a direction"] --> M["Matrix: m × n grid<br/>a transformation"]
  M --> MM["Matrix multiply<br/>(m × n) @ (n × p) = (m × p)<br/>inner sizes must match"]
  M --> EW["Element-wise<br/>same shapes, position by position"]
  MM --> BC["Broadcasting<br/>add a bias vector to every row"]
  BC --> NN["A neural layer: y = X @ W + b"]
  EW --> NN
